 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following scenario for questions 11 and 12:</p>\n  <p>The drama club is printing T-shirts for its members. The printing company charges a certain amount for each T-shirt plus a setup fee of $40. There are 21 students in the drama club.</p><br>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 645843,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"10\">\n  <li>If there are 21 students in the club and the T-shirt order costs a total of $187, how much does each T-shirt cost?</li>\n</ol>",
